                "**Separate metrics?** Otherwise you cannot tell which stage failed."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Chunk Size and Overlap",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Chunk Size and Overlap",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Size and overlap",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Chunk size== = tokens per embedding",
                "==Overlap== = share of previous chunk repeated at the next chunk's start",
                "Start: **256-512** tokens, **10-20%** overlap",
                "Tune on ==recall@k== with your own queries"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Size",
                "Pro",
                "Con"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Small 100-200",
                  "precise match",
                  "loses context"
                ],
                [
                  "Large 800-1500",
                  "keeps context",
                  "dilutes embedding, wastes prompt"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Overlap",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Stops a fact being split across a boundary",
                "Size 500, overlap 50: chunk 2 starts at token ==450==",
                "Cost: {red:bigger index}, near-duplicate hits"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Split order",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Headings",
                    "sub": "first",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Paragraphs, code blocks",
                    "sub": "next",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Fixed token window",
                    "sub": "fallback",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Zero overlap",
                "50% overlap duplicates the index",
                "One chunk size for every doc type"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Choose size?** Compare candidates by recall@k.",
                "**Overlap?** Fixes split facts; costs index size.",
                "**Bigger chunk, lower precision?** Embedding blends many topics."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Metadata Filtering and Hybrid Search",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Metadata Filtering and Hybrid Search",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Filtering: pre vs post",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Metadata filter== limits candidates by **source, date, tenant_id, doc type, language**",
                "Fields must be stored at ingest"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Pre-filter",
                "Post-filter"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Order",
                  "Inside the ANN search",
                  "Top-k first, then filter"
                ],
                [
                  "Results",
                  "Exact, k kept",
                  "Can return fewer than k or zero"
                ],
                [
                  "Verdict",
                  "{green:Prefer}",
                  "{red:Avoid if selective}"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Hybrid search and RRF",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Query",
                    "ink": "black"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "BM25 + dense",
                    "sub": "in parallel",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Merge ranks",
                    "sub": "RRF",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Top-k",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Use hybrid when queries hold ==IDs, acronyms, error codes==",
                "==RRF== score = sum of `1/(k+rank)` over lists, k ≈ 60",
                "RRF needs **no** score normalisation",
                "Weighted sum needs normalised scores"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Filtering on fields never stored at ingest",
                "Post-filtering with a selective filter",
                "Summing raw BM25 and cosine scores"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Pre vs post?** Pre filters inside ANN; post can return fewer than k.",
                "**Why RRF?** Raw BM25 and cosine scales differ.",
                "**BM25 beats embeddings when?** Exact IDs, codes, acronyms."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Multi-tenant data",
              "text": "Always filter by ==tenant_id==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Re-ranking and Query Rewriting",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Re-ranking and Query Rewriting",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Re-ranking: Two Stages",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Retrieve",
                    "sub": "about 50 candidates",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Re-rank",
                    "sub": "cross-encoder rescores",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Keep",
                    "sub": "top 3-5",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Bi-encoder",
                "Cross-encoder"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Reads",
                  "query, doc apart",
                  "query + doc together"
                ],
                [
                  "Indexable",
                  "{green:yes}",
                  "{red:no}"
                ],
                [
                  "Speed / accuracy",
                  "fast / good",
                  "slow / ==higher=="
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A re-ranker ==rescores== the candidates and reorders them",
                "It only reorders stage 1 results: a missing answer stays missing",
                "Fix ==recall== first, then precision"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Query Rewriting",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Technique",
                "What it does"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Expand",
                  "spell out abbreviations"
                ],
                [
                  "Standalone",
                  "follow-up + chat history becomes a full question"
                ],
                [
                  "==HyDE==",
                  "embed a generated hypothetical answer"
                ],
                [
                  "Multi-query",
                  "several paraphrases, results merged"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Re-ranking too few candidates",
                "Rewrite that drifts from the user's intent",
                "Added latency with no measured gain"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Bi- vs cross-encoder?** Separate, indexable vectors vs joint reading that is more accurate",
                "**Cross-encoder for first stage?** It scores every pair with no index: too slow over the corpus",
                "**Rewriting in chat?** It turns a vague follow-up into a standalone query"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Measuring Retrieval: recall@k and MRR",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Measuring Retrieval: recall@k and MRR",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Labelled set",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "(query, ==relevant IDs==) pairs, ideally **50-200 real queries**",
                "No set = tuning is ==guesswork=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The two metrics",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "recall@k",
                "MRR"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Score",
                  "relevant found in top k, averaged; one relevant chunk = **hit rate**",
                  "mean of 1/rank of first hit"
                ],
                [
                  "Example",
                  "8 of 10 queries hit in top 5 = ==0.8==",
                  "ranks 1, 2, 4: (1+0.5+0.25)/3 = ==0.583=="
                ],
                [
                  "Measures",
                  "candidate coverage",
                  "ordering, rewards right chunk first"
                ],
                [
                  "Use for",
                  "stage 1",
                  "re-ranker (or nDCG)"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Tuning loop",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Label set",
                    "sub": "50-200 queries",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Baseline",
                    "sub": "recall@k, MRR",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Change ONE thing",
                    "sub": "chunk size, hybrid",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Re-measure",
                    "sub": "keep if better",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Synthetic queries only",
                "Tuning on the test queries",
                "Average only: ==inspect failing queries==",
                "k larger than the prompt can hold"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**recall@k vs MRR?** Coverage in top k vs rank of first hit",
                "**Two chunk sizes?** Same labelled set, change only size, compare recall@k",
                "**Why not end-to-end only?** It hides whether retrieval or generation failed"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
